@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Unduh CSV Data Presensi Berdasarkan Filter Tertentu (Tata Usaha)

actor "Tata Usaha" as TU
boundary View as V
control Controller as C
entity Model as M
boundary "File System" as FS

== Main Flow - Unduh CSV Data Presensi ==

TU -> V: 1. Akses Dashboard
V --> TU: Tampilkan Dashboard Tata Usaha

TU -> V: 2. Tekan sidebar dropdown "Presensi Siswa"
V -> C: 2.1: Handle dropdown menu
C -> V: 2.2: Show dropdown options
V --> TU: 2.3: Tampilkan pilihan dropdown

TU -> V: 3. Tekan dropdown "Rekap Kehadiran"
V -> C: 3.1: Handle navigation to rekap kehadiran
C -> M: 3.2: Get attendance data and filter options
M --> C: 3.3: Return data with available filters
C -> V: 3.4: Load rekap kehadiran page
V --> TU: 3.5: Tampilkan halaman "Rekap Kehadiran" dengan filter options

== Alternative Flow - Apply Filters ==

group Filter Selection
    alt apply filters
        TU -> V: 4.1: Pilih filter (tanggal/angkatan/kelas/semester)
        V -> C: 4.1.1: Handle filter selection
        C -> M: 4.1.2: Apply selected filters
        M --> C: 4.1.3: Return filtered data
        C -> V: 4.1.4: Update display with filtered results
        V --> TU: 4.1.5: Tampilkan data sesuai filter
    else no filters
        note over TU: Use default/current data
    end
end

== CSV Export Process ==

TU -> V: 5. Tekan tombol "Export CSV"
V -> C: 5.1: Handle CSV export request
C -> M: 5.2: Get current filtered data
M --> C: 5.3: Return attendance data for export

C -> FS: 5.4: Generate CSV file with filtered data
FS --> C: 5.5: CSV file created successfully

C -> V: 5.6: Prepare file download
V --> TU: 5.7: Download CSV file to local device

group Export Confirmation
    alt successful export
        C -> V: 6.1: Show success notification
        V --> TU: 6.2: "Data berhasil diekspor ke format CSV"
        C -> FS: 6.3: Clean up temporary files
    else export failed
        C -> V: 6.4: Show error notification
        V --> TU: 6.5: "Gagal mengekspor data, silakan coba lagi"
    end
end

note over TU, M
Pre-kondisi:
- Tata Usaha berada pada halaman Dashboard
- Data presensi siswa tersedia dalam sistem

Post-kondisi:
- Data siswa sudah terunduh dengan format CSV
- File CSV dapat diolah kembali oleh Tata Usaha
- Data sesuai filter yang ditentukan:
  * Tanggal, Angkatan, Kelas, Semester
end note

@enduml